{"id":"658397","name":"韭菜炒面线","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658397/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面线","amount":"200g"},{"name":"韭菜","amount":"1把"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜末","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面线是熟的，还带有咸味。","img":"images/658397/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"先放入清水中浸泡半个小时，把咸味泡淡。","img":"images/658397/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"韭菜清洗干净。","img":"images/658397/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切成段，备用。","img":"images/658397/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"猪肉切成丝，用酱油、淀粉、油拌均。","img":"images/658397/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备适量的蒜末。","img":"images/658397/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"起锅热油，倒入肉丝。","img":"images/658397/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒熟铲出。","img":"images/658397/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入蒜末炒香。","img":"images/658397/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入面线。","img":"images/658397/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"两面炒至焦香。","img":"images/658397/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"倒入韭菜翻炒。","img":"images/658397/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"韭菜炒至断生，加入肉丝。","img":"images/658397/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"淋入酱油，撒入胡椒粉，炒出香味出锅。","img":"images/658397/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658397/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}